      "cooked": "<p>It’s spectacular</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-287-writers-room-legacy-independence-day-spectacular-one-shot\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-287-writers-room-legacy-independence-day-spectacular-one-shot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-287-writers-room-legacy-independence-day-spectacular-one-shot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #287 - Writers' Room: Legacy Independence Day...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Welcome to July! Let's kick off this Legacy month with the most Legacy book of all time! Front Cover:  Back Cover:  Entire Wrap:  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:48:33 Adam really outdid himself with the cover, and we craft the story that leads to such a...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b_2_377x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"98NIRPyCj84PDYx0EWWcZRPYsBl\" width=\"377\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b_2_377x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b_2_565x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b_2_754x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/401247c82ee5a184e64d9aba0bbacee2616a776b_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2544 848 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c_2_377x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hazEJNjfzm0hCw8uSefreRCnw8A\" width=\"377\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c_2_377x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c_2_565x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c_2_754x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7856fbb235e4fda20b7f3e324cb878a93c17779c_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</s