      "id": 259643,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-07-02T17:18:21.957Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am here to discover if the story really does fit that amazing cover. :3</p>\n<p>Pssh, as though a simple death ray would do anything to Teddy Roosevelt. :V</p>\n<p>oh, so the villain is a modern-day politician, melting smiley face emoji</p>\n<p>I did not expect this would give them an opportunity to dive into Legacy not just being a jingoistic blind patriot, that’s a pleasant surprise.</p>\n<p>Oh, the villain is a future president? So a modern-day politican then…</p>\n<p>“Imperius, the Paradox President” they’re right, it’s too good, omg</p>\n<p>Ahh, so Legacy was Xanatos the whole time.</p>\n<p><em>He’s a Parsons???</em> Okay, yeah, this is amazing, I love it XD</p>\n<p>By George (Washington), I think they’ve done it! I feel sorry for all of the non-US listeners, for like, this whole month, omg</p>\n<p>I wonder if President Paradox still has the Parsons Family secret sauce.</p>\n<p>“You cannot give him Bunker’s brain.” Well not with <em>that</em> attitude!</p>\n<p>“You should wrap yourself in layers of others.” Oh, so Adam is <em>not</em> advocating wearing other people’s skin. c_c;</p>\n<p>Therapy <em>is</em> great!</p>\n<p>“The stabbing point of the cutting edge” is amazing</p>\n<p>Whoever wrote the Sk8blayd letter, your sister is absolutely right XD</p>\n<p>…There are other Night Snake fans? :V I kid</p>\n<p>So the Naturalist is still Deadline’s nemesis, huh?</p>\n<p>Would a villain catch a hero dyin’ in the juice?</p>",
