      "raw": "I am here to discover if the story really does fit that amazing cover. :3\n\nPssh, as though a simple death ray would do anything to Teddy Roosevelt. :V\n\noh, so the villain is a modern-day politician, melting smiley face emoji\n\nI did not expect this would give them an opportunity to dive into Legacy not just being a jingoistic blind patriot, that's a pleasant surprise.\n\nOh, the villain is a future president? So a modern-day politican then...\n\n\"Imperius, the Paradox President\" they're right, it's too good, omg\n\nAhh, so Legacy was Xanatos the whole time.\n\n*He's a Parsons???* Okay, yeah, this is amazing, I love it XD\n\nBy George (Washington), I think they've done it! I feel sorry for all of the non-US listeners, for like, this whole month, omg\n\nI wonder if President Paradox still has the Parsons Family secret sauce.\n\n\"You cannot give him Bunker's brain.\" Well not with *that* attitude!\n\n\"You should wrap yourself in layers of others.\" Oh, so Adam is *not* advocating wearing other people's skin. c_c;\n\nTherapy *is* great!\n\n\"The stabbing point of the cutting edge\" is amazing\n\nWhoever wrote the Sk8blayd letter, your sister is absolutely right XD\n\n...There are other Night Snake fans? :V I kid\n\nSo the Naturalist is still Deadline's nemesis, huh?\n\nWould a villain catch a hero dyin' in the juice?",
