      "created_at": "2024-07-02T18:13:51.762Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Have to say, my current level of cynicism is showing. I was… actually disappointed. It felt like something out of the 70s… kinda. I was hoping to have something more like Superman vs the KKK rather than Captain America’s bicentennial special.</p>",
